    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Lisney Sotheby International Realty are delighted to present this wonderful property. It is one of just eight terraced houses in Orwell Park Gardens and is beautifully presented in show house condition. To the front, it enjoys period design echoes, with bay windows, 2.7m high ceilings, and an arched surround to the front doorway.\r\n\r\nThe ground floor consists of a large L Shape bespoke Nolan Kitchen, which comes with quartz pencil edge worktops, a Blanco stainless-steel under-mounted sink, a Davenport chrome mixer set, and a Quooker boiling water tap. Downstairs there is a sizeable separate utility with WC. The hallway then leads into a spectacular living space with glass sliding doors opening out to a south-facing garden with newly fitted astroturf. \r\n\r\nOn the first floor, there are three large double rooms, one of which is ensuite. There is also a large bathroom on this floor. On the second floor, there is another large double bedroom that covers the footprint of the property, again with an ensuite. \r\n\r\nThe development is located off the tree-lined Orwell Park, nestled between Orwell Road and Dartry Road is within walking distance of Rathgar village. Rathgar is a much sought-after residential location with a host of restaurants and amenities. The Green Luas is within walking distance. The property also comes with 2 Parking Spaces."
      },
